      "200\n",
      "{'status': 'success', 'text': '\\n\\nAI tools can significantly boost your development speed and quality by automating repetitive tasks and acting as a pair programmer. Here are the top categories to consider:\\n\\n*   **Code Generation:** Tools like **GitHub Copilot** or **Amazon CodeWhisperer** suggest snippets and boilerplate code as you type, helping you write faster.\\n*   **AI-Native IDEs:** Editors like **Cursor** allow you to chat directly with your codebase, making it easier to refactor, debug, and understand complex projects.\\n*   **Documentation & Testing:** AI can generate unit tests, summarize long files, or explain legacy code in plain English instantly.\\n\\n**Pro Tip:** Treat AI as a powerful assistant, not an autopilot. Always review generated code for security vulnerabilities and logic errors before integrating it into your project.'}\n"
